{"seq":1,"slug":"controversies","title":"争议","docCount":2,"url":"/c/people/john-von-neumann/controversies-and-appraisal/controversies","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-ethics-of-the-bomb","title":"原子弹的伦理之争","url":"/c/people/john-von-neumann/controversies-and-appraisal/controversies/the-ethics-of-the-bomb","wordCount":1909,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"cold-war-hawkishness","title":"冷战鹰派之争","url":"/c/people/john-von-neumann/controversies-and-appraisal/controversies/cold-war-hawkishness","wordCount":1587,"readingTime":7}],"introMarkdown":"# 争议\n\n本章客观地呈现围绕冯·诺依曼的主要争议。冯·诺依曼参与原子弹研制所涉及的伦理问题，以及他在冷战时期所持的强硬立场，是评价他时不可回避的争议。两篇文档，分别呈现原子弹的伦理之争，以及冷战鹰派之争，力求客观而全面。\n"}